# modules/eudr

- Domain libs: DDS determination/inputs, PDF sections, question ids, risk calc, workflow/risultato/search.
- Shim: `src/lib/eudr-*` → edit `modules/eudr/`.
- Actions stay in `src/actions/**` (`eudr-due-diligence.ts`, `workflows/**`).
- AOI/Earth Engine feature: `modules/eudr-due-diligence/` + `module-eudr-due-diligence.mdc`.
- UI routes: `src/app/EUDR/**` only.
